  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#000\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PcXKgc6.png\" alt=\"尤里卡！\" width=\"808\" height=\"287\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvalkyrienskies.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">官网</a> | <a href=\"https://discord.gg/dWwM8G3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Eureka\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eureka-ships/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载 Fabric 版 </a>| </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eureka-ships/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">下载 Forge 版</span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">使用普通（或模组添加的！）Minecraft 方块打造属于你的船只，放置船舵后按住 Shift 右键点击进行组装，随后见证你的作品瞬间获得物理特性。从此，你的建筑不再受限于静止状态，永远固定在同一位置。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000;font-weight:bold\">注意：尽管 Valkyrien Skies 是一款拟真物理引擎，但 Eureka 的船只并不具备完全拟真的物理效果。为了便于造船，所有船舵都会施加稳定力/力矩。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Eureka 是 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Valkyrien Skies</em> </a>的一个简单附加组件，完美契合原版美学风格，操作简单且充满乐趣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用普通（或模组添加的！）Minecraft 方块打造属于你的船只，放置船舵后按住 Shift 右键点击进行组装，随后见证你的作品瞬间获得物理特性。从此，你的建筑不再受限于静止状态，永远固定在同一位置。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DaxvXa9.png\" alt=\"Eureka 模组方块\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1057\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LuYnqaVUuQA\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/o0Bf9gBGJwA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">依赖项</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valkyrien Skies</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API（仅限 1.16）</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API（仅限 1.16）</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin For Forge（仅 Forge 用户需要）</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API（仅 Fabric 用户需要）</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin（仅 1.16 Fabric 用户需要）</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu（仅 Fabric 用户需要）</a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">材质包</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eureka-create-airships\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#000\">Eureka! Create Airships!</span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/393061443492118541/1063247181718499359/helms.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"278\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fvalkyrien-skies-eureka-re-texture%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eureka! Re-Texture</a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"width:757px;margin-left:4px\" src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2023/499/16454249_l.webp\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>*Eureka 是从零开始开发的，并非基于 Archimedes Ships 等之前的飞艇模组代码。</p>",
